  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Roughly chop tomato.<br>• Place on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to combine and roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931b5f7d5496ac4a6e818/step-76713f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, cut mini flour tortillas into 2cm strips. Finely chop or crush garlic.<br>• In a small bowl combine garlic and a generous drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.<br>• Place strips in a single layer on a second lined oven tray and drizzle or brush with garlic olive oil.<br>• Bake until golden, 6-8 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931b5f7d5496ac4a6e818/step-71691410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When veggies have 10 mins remaining, drain and rinse red kidney beans.<br>• In a saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook kidney beans and garlic seasoning until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Stir in diced tomatoes, the stock powder and water and cook until slightly <br>reduced, 2-3 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931b5f7d5496ac4a6e818/step-c6ecda20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Stir roasted veggies and baby spinach into soup mixture and cook until wilted, 1-2 mins. Season to taste.<br>• Divide bean and veggie soup between bowls. Sprinkle over the chilli flakes<br>(if using).<br>• Serve with garlic tortilla dippers. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931b5f7d5496ac4a6e818/step-1f960930.jpg"
    }
  ]
